      "version": 0,
      "html": "<div data-schema-version=\"9\"><p>Comment: Project page: https://xetroubadour.github.io/Uni-LaViRA/</p>\n<p>SCB - Second Chance Backtrack</p>\n<p>TDM - TODO Memory List</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" width=\"1130\" height=\"947\" data-attachment-key=\"84KK2U8S\"></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">Uni-LaViRA Architecture</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">1) Language Action</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">2) Vision Action</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">3) Robot Action</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">TODO List Memory</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">sliding window of recent observations</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px;\" data-indent=\"3\">1.Representations:<img alt=\"\" width=\"577\" height=\"138\" data-attachment-key=\"5LVJP669\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px;\" data-indent=\"3\">2.Initializaion:</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px;\" data-indent=\"3\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"556\" height=\"79\" data-attachment-key=\"PJUKEPVL\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px;\" data-indent=\"3\">3.Update:</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 160px;\" data-indent=\"4\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"448\" height=\"117\" data-attachment-key=\"WN7DCVW8\">Update, Rewrite, Add</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">PROMPT ONLY</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">SCB</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">a. backtrack as an explicit action</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">b. the second-chance re-decision</p>\n<p></p>\n</div>",
